      "writtenOn": "2023-07-20T18:20:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there any benefit to reporting this to AP? Since the EC is making the supported decision I don\u0027t think there is any reason to tell the AP \"here\u0027s what I have but you can\u0027t do anything with it\"",
      "parentUuid": "f2378db8_123a0851",
      "revId": "cbe321c1502d127cb9060bbdb9bb8979bef15d08",
