      "side": 1,
      "message": "If there needs to be board-specific logic, it should be in the form of an `__overridable` function named `board_*`, and this function should call that function. (The default would just return true.) As much as possible, I don\u0027t want to conflate logic about the cable with logic about the board, and I don\u0027t want to copy cable logic around board files when they need to override.",
