        "id": 1131142
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-02T20:58:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe the intent of this function was to follow figure 5-3 from the spec hence why this check is here. I also can\u0027t seem to find anywhere else where this will break DP alt mode entry as the USB_R20_SS_U2_ONLY seems to default to HBR3 in all checks. This code is checking for that value and Passive cable to return false.",
